            <ArticleTitle>Conservative treatment of Myofascial Trigger Points and joint mobilization for management in patients with thumb carpometacarpal osteoarthritis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>89-92; quiz 92</MedlinePgn>
